msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"I wonder if that business between the Tojo Clan and the Omi Alliance from a "
"while back is really over. Somehow I doubt it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid "Why's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"If you want to win a war, you gotta finish the job, completely annihilate "
"the other side. Doing it halfway'll just make your enemy want to get "
"revenge later on."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"People can hold grudges for years⑬even decades! The ones who've stuck "
"around may end up striking at the Tojo Clan sooner or later..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "(Just like the Jingweon Mafia...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"The Tojo Clan has to immediately choose a sixth chairman and bring the clan "
"back together if they want to prevent the Omi Alliance from retaliating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"With a strong leader at the helm, they won't have to deal with any "
"dissension in their ranks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "(I'll have to convince Majima to support Daigo...)"
msgstr ""

